Object.assign(translations,{"周一至周五营业，07:00–16:30；周末非营业。": {"en": "Open Monday–Friday, 07:00–16:30; closed on weekends.", "ms": "Buka Isnin–Jumaat, 07:00–16:30; tutup pada hujung minggu."}, "营业时间由同学于 2026年10月4日提供。": {"en": "Hours provided by a student on 4 October 2026.", "ms": "Waktu diberikan oleh pelajar pada 4 Oktober 2026."}, "领取时间请见下方时间表。": {"en": "See the collection hours below.", "ms": "Lihat waktu pengambilan di bawah."}, "来源：Pusat Parcel 营业时间告示 · 2026年10月4日整理。": {"en": "Source: Pusat Parcel opening-hours notice, recorded 4 October 2026.", "ms": "Sumber: Notis waktu operasi Pusat Parcel, direkod 4 Oktober 2026."}, "查看包裹中心营业时间告示": {"en": "View the parcel centre opening-hours notice", "ms": "Lihat notis waktu operasi Pusat Parcel"}, "周一至四及周日 09:30–18:00；周五 09:30–12:20、14:40–18:00；周六非营业。": {"en": "Monday–Thursday and Sunday: 09:30–18:00; Friday: 09:30–12:20 and 14:40–18:00; closed Saturday.", "ms": "Isnin–Khamis dan Ahad: 09:30–18:00; Jumaat: 09:30–12:20 dan 14:40–18:00; tutup Sabtu."}});

